{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30419","headline":"赠曹处士幽居 · 赵嘏","name":"赠曹处士幽居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勾漏先生冰玉然，曾将八石问羣仙。\n中山暂醉一千日，南苑往来三百年。\n碁局不收花满洞，霓旌欲别浪翻天。\n何须更学鸱夷子，头白江湖一短船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}